  "description": "CAP1 DRAFT ONLY. Show the still-balanced remainder after removing three noodle boxes from each pan of fig-77: two boxes on the left, two weights marked 2 on the right. Do not add the solved box mass. Original PNG independently opened once. Context: ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/4m/editions/modern-us-neutral/figures/evidence/fig-78/context.json; SHA-256 0eebc5532e0149cab32770c65ae191afaf2607b2b29287848f5764cb2a9cea90. Modern additions/regularization: clean equal-arm balance, schematic boxes and weights, horizontal English labels, common kg legend derived from prose, semantic colors; coordinates are layout units, not source measurements. HOLD-78-DISPLAY: headed media sizing and render/label clearance remain unverified; 640 scroll width comes only from the skill contract. No rendering, generation or approval.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/4m/figures/fig-78.png",
      "sha256": "f628a83f57bf3d0114cd99a6cb3bf86ba9bd3f625b137a5afc0194716dce9fcf"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n19",
        "text": "19. 方程"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n19",
        "text": "我们已经列出了方程。\n要解这个方程，我们从两边的盘子里各取掉3盒面条。\n这样，在左面的盘子里还剩下2盒面条（图78），而在右面的盘子里就剩下两个2公斤的法码。\n\n这时天秤仍平衡。\n显然，每盒面条重2公斤。\n也就是，只有当$x=2$时，等式$5x=3x+4$才是真的。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n19",
        "text": "图77"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n19",
        "text": "根据问题的条件列方程。\n设一盒面条重$x$公斤，那么5盒重$5x$公斤，而3盒重$3x$公斤。\n右面盘子里的总质量是$3x+4$公斤，而左面盘子里是$5x$公斤。\n\n因为天秤平衡，所以应从变量$x$的一切值中求出使下列等式为真的那些值：\n$5x=3x+4$"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n19",
        "text": "图78"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n19",
        "text": "含变量的等式叫做方程。\n使等式为真的变量的每个值叫做方程的根。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n19",
        "text": "解方程就是求它的根的集合。"
      }
    ],
